# Build context hygiene for the pilot image (doc 70). Keep the context small —
# the Dockerfile only needs source + workspace manifests + migrations + scripts.

# deps + build output (reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# the mobile app is NOT part of the pilot API image (4+ GB of android/ + deps)
apps/mobile

# secrets & local env — never in an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# vcs / editor / OS
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# large local-only material
Tai lieu
File du an
packages/testing/vision-benchmark-data/images
**/.dz-uploads

# paid-run artifacts / scratch reports (also gitignored)
CALIB*.txt
ROUND*.txt
ROUND*.jsonl
WS_*.txt
WS_*.jsonl
GROUPC_XCHECK*
D7_COHORT*.txt
WAVE1_REPORT*.txt
INSP.txt
PICK.txt

# coverage / playwright (test SOURCE stays — some tsconfigs compile it)
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright
